"""
TokenZero Engine: Deterministic Agent Kernel
Powered by Takefuji Formula-First & Jake Van Clief ICM Disciplines

Core Architecture:
- Tier 0: Deterministic Formula & Safe Code Synthesis (0ms, 0 cost, 0% error)
- Tier 1: Local System 1 Near-Neighbor Inference (LAYA Multilingual / ModernBERT)
- Tier 2: Safe Escalation to Full LLM (Only when context/chaos requires it)
- ROI Tracker: Automatic token, cost, and time savings logging.
"""

